(1, '2024-05-13 06:39:16', NULL, 'Happy Mother\'s Day', '<p>Top tip: the bits in brackets are things you could add to personalise the message, add in whatever you fancy (weÔÇÖve popped some ideas in to get you thinking).</p><ul>\r\n<li>Happy Mother\'s Day to the best [gardening, dog-walking, flat-pack-making] mum in the world! I hope your day is full of all your favourite things ÔÇô you deserve it.</li><li>Mum. Not only are you the best at [catching spiders], youÔÇÖre also the best at being my mum. Love you lots!</li><li>Wishing you all the love in the world on MotherÔÇÖs Day. Thanks for everything you do for the kids. They love you to bits and canÔÇÖt wait to [watch cartoons and go bug hunting with you].</li><li>There isnÔÇÖt a card big enough to list all the things I love about you ÔÇô [your questionable dancing, your love of Dolly Parton and your ability to turn anything into a positive], to name just a few. Love you lots and lots.</li><li>Thanks for everything this year, and well, every year! YouÔÇÖre a mum in a million.</li><li>Happy MotherÔÇÖs Day. I hope you know just how much I love you.</li><li>Happy MotherÔÇÖs Day! You inspire me, and I canÔÇÖt believe how lucky I am to have you as my mum.</li><li>Have a wonderful Mother\'s Day, Mum. I love you more than words can say!</li></ul>', '2024-05-14 07:00:00', '2024-05-14 11:00:00', '#591cd9', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'event', 'public', 0, 236, 'SBC Solution', 'https://www.google.com/maps/place/SBC+Solutions/@11.5462237,104.9026578,3a,75y,330.86h,90t/data=!3m7!1e1!3m5!1sn38oQkTie3S2MJCoal35Zg!2e0!6shttps://streetviewpixels-pa.googleapis.com/v1/thumbnail?panoid=n38oQkTie3S2MJCoal35Zg&cb_client=maps_sv.tactile.gps&w=203&h=100&yaw=330.85928&pitch=0&thumbfov=100!7i13312!8i6656!4m10!1m2!2m1!1s#+B87+Street+199+Sangkat+Tumnob+Terk,+12306!3m6!1s0x310951707f8a077f:0xd3af2b8dbe3e2a50!8m2!3d11.5462393!4d104.9026468!10e5!16s/g/11gjxrrjhc?entry=ttu', 1, 1, '0d4030553ade817ecbc7883b76b81010.jpg', '11'),
