(2401, 'quantity_out_of_stock_for_\%s', 'Item \%s does not have the ordered quantity in stock. Please change quantity to lower number or remove it from cart.', 'Item \%s does not have the ordered quantity in stock. Please change quantity to lower number or remove it from cart.', 'Item \%s does not have the ordered quantity in stock. Please change quantity to lower number or remove it from cart.', 'Item \%s does not have the ordered quantity in stock. Please change quantity to lower number or remove it from cart.', 'Item \%s does not have the ordered quantity in stock. Please change quantity to lower number or remove it from cart.'),
